            "text": "{\"title\":\"Hearty Polish Breakfast Stew with Kielbasa and Eggs\",\"readyInMinutes\":40,\"servings\":4,\"summary\":\"Experience a morning full of robust flavors with this \u003cb\u003ePolish breakfast stew\u003c/b\u003e, a delightful morning interpretation of classic bigos. Traditional Polish cuisine often relies on savory, fermented elements to kickstart the day, and this breakfast variation marries tangy sauerkraut with juicy \u003cb\u003ewhite kielbasa sausage\u003c/b\u003e and crispy bacon for a warming dish. By slowly simmering cured meats with mushrooms and caraway, the stew develops an intense umami depth that warms you from the inside out. Instead of hours of boiling, this streamlined version focuses on vibrant ingredients suitable for a brisk morning routine. Soft-cooked eggs are gently poached directly inside the simmering skillet base, creating luscious yolks that rich bread can soak up easily. Finished with golden \u003cb\u003erye bread croutons\u003c/b\u003e and chopped fresh dill, this dish offers a wonderful contrast of textures between tender cabbage, crispy croutons, and velvety egg yolk. It provides a substantial boost of energy and protein, making it ideal for brisk autumn mornings or weekend brunches. Serve this unique \u003cb\u003ebreakfast bigos\u003c/b\u003e hot with additional buttered bread for an authentic taste of hearty Polish hospitality that will keep you full for hours.\",\"nutrition\":{\"nutrients\":[{\"name\":\"Calories\",\"amount\":480,\"unit\":\"kcal\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":24},{\"name\":\"Fat\",\"amount\":32,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":41},{\"name\":\"Saturated Fat\",\"amount\":12,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":60},{\"name\":\"Carbohydrates\",\"amount\":18,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":7},{\"name\":\"Sugar\",\"amount\":4,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":4},{\"name\":\"Protein\",\"amount\":28,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":56},{\"name\":\"Cholesterol\",\"amount\":245